# Package default jumps — prefer editing user config:
#   %APPDATA%\dnav\jumps
# Format:  key   path   → shell command dKEY (home → dhome)
# Reload: djump -r
# Paths: ~ expands; .. is parent of $PWD
#
# key     path
home      ~
doc       ~/Documents
down      ~/Downloads
pic       ~/Pictures
desk      ~/Desktop
music     ~/Music
vid       ~/Videos
proj      ~/Projects
con       ~/.config
bk        ..
